		(property "Description" "Fed from +5V: true 5 V even with +5V in dropout on a USB port. PS/SYNC low: power save, the converter never sinks current from a target that holds the rail higher. Load disconnected in shutdown (§7.3.3). PG unused (no MCU pin left): the INA226 reads the output"
